<view class="page">
  <view class="header">
    <text class="title">欢迎使用</text>
    <text class="subtitle">请选择您的身份</text>
  </view>

  <view class="role-list">

    <view
      class="role-card"
      data-role="teacher"
      bindtap="selectRole"
    >
      <view class="role-icon">👩‍🏫</view>
      <view class="role-content">
        <text class="role-title">我是教师</text>
        <text class="role-desc">记录教学思考、学生观察与教学反思</text>
      </view>
      <text class="arrow">›</text>
    </view>

    <view class="role-card" bindtap="openStudentCollection">
      <view class="role-icon">👨‍👩‍👧</view>
      <view class="role-content">
        <text class="role-title">学生采集</text>
        <text class="role-desc">使用线下发放的绑定码进入学生采集</text>
      </view>
      <text class="arrow">›</text>
    </view>

  </view>

  <view class="footer">
    <text class="footer-text">
      学生是独立研究主体，微信账号仅作为采集终端
    </text>
  </view>
</view>
